# W10c, guest b (k9, DW4_ONLINE_TEST_IGNORE_HOME=1: a client that never answers its JOIN_REQ home): a guest's NEW at
# stag0101, a solo-led stage group of a's instance on a's story. Removed (a removes at @260), it plays on: a story value it
# makes 6 s later goes out with a's owner key and is refused (owner); the relay detaches its stage group after
# Instances:JoinRequestTries unanswered asks (5 s each), and its next barrier (the gate disc) is a DISSOLVE home on its own
# story (the own-story check of the card and the server story).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@160
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log b in stag0101 apart from a
wander 460 200 20 until epoch>=@266 fail stage=stagml11
log b removed but playing on
setflag 595
log b made a story value
wander 460 200 20 until epoch>=@300 fail stage=stagml11
log b detached
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control fail epoch>=@500
log b home
idle until frames>=120
log own story at home
